# Apps the enforcer restarts when they still run old code. Copy to
# ~/.config/mac-secure/restart-apps.txt to change the list.
# Format: name|app path|executable in Contents/MacOS|arguments for the restart
Google Chrome|/Applications/Google Chrome.app|Google Chrome|--restore-last-session
Microsoft Edge|/Applications/Microsoft Edge.app|Microsoft Edge|--restore-last-session
Brave Browser|/Applications/Brave Browser.app|Brave Browser|--restore-last-session
Firefox|/Applications/Firefox.app|firefox|
